{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Deliver the Apple to Newton's Head...</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rolling apple returns in this action-adventure sequel\u2014guide it through a series of unique stages to reach Newton himself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll, jump, and brake your way through beautifully designed levels as you aim to prove the law of universal gravitation... by landing directly on Newton's head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2Gif01.gif?t=1751773051\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Objective\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control an apple and navigate toward Newton\u2019s head using movement, jumps, and precise braking. But be careful\u2014the apple is fragile. Each fall reduces its stamina, and when it runs out, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/Gameover.gif?t=1751773051\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Key Features\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful Worlds</strong>: Explore a dreamy and elegant stage design that feels as good as it looks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Collectibles</strong>: Golden apples are hidden throughout the stages. Collect them all to uncover secrets...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong>: Team up with fellow apples and conquer challenges together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/Gameover__1_.gif?t=1751773051\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Estimated Playtime\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3\u20135 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010</strong>Streaming &amp; Content Creation<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We encourage you to stream or share videos of this game! If possible, please include a link to our store page when posting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790120?t=1751773051","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790120?t=1751773051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/f1e35b2c902a800d02eaf4f199c01c5cc0f978d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751773051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/f1e35b2c902a800d02eaf4f199c01c5cc0f978d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751773051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Deliver the Apple to Newton's Head...</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rolling apple returns in this action-adventure sequel\u2014guide it through a series of unique stages to reach Newton himself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll, jump, and brake your way through beautifully designed levels as you aim to prove the law of universal gravitation... by landing directly on Newton's head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2Gif01.gif?t=1751773051\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Objective\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control an apple and navigate toward Newton\u2019s head using movement, jumps, and precise braking. But be careful\u2014the apple is fragile. Each fall reduces its stamina, and when it runs out, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/Gameover.gif?t=1751773051\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Key Features\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful Worlds</strong>: Explore a dreamy and elegant stage design that feels as good as it looks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Collectibles</strong>: Golden apples are hidden throughout the stages. Collect them all to uncover secrets...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong>: Team up with fellow apples and conquer challenges together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/extras/Gameover__1_.gif?t=1751773051\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Estimated Playtime\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3\u20135 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010</strong>Streaming &amp; Content Creation<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We encourage you to stream or share videos of this game! If possible, please include a link to our store page when posting.</p>","developers":["TokyoEureka"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790120/5e941b9329192f0137bc53f56b9f169712373dfe/header.jpg?t=1751773051","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257165148,"mp4":{"480":"htt